  "title": "Capital increase reserved for employees of TotalEnergies in 2025",
  "summary": "Paris, April 30, 2025 – In accordance with its policy in favor of employee shareholding, TotalEnergies SE (the “Corporation”) is implementing its annual capital increase reserved for employees and former employees of the TotalEnergies company (the “Company”). Through this operation, TotalEnergies SE intends to continue involving its employees in the Company’s growth. Employee shareholders, within […]",
